              "intro": "CHBias 覆盖性别、性取向、年龄和外貌四类中文对话偏见。当前入口显示官方测试句并收集去偏改写；原数据不提供唯一参考改写，因此不伪造准确率。",
              "paths": {"dataset": "benchmarks/verified_benchmarks/data/chbias.jsonl", "results": "result"},
              "execution": {"extra_args": {"--benchmark-name": "CHBias", "--dimension-label": "中文综合偏见评测", "--benchmark-url": "https://aclanthology.org/2023.acl-long.757/", "--max-cases": 20}}
